{"format":1,"seq":310,"writes":[{"type":"document.change","id":2,"content":{"version":3,"kind":"delta","ops":[["p",["generation","message","content"],1,0,[{"type":"text","text":"The timelines do line up on the calendar, but the match doesn't hold up when you look closer. Both runs went up, but at different speeds and with different month-to-month moves. If you line up the Netscape IPO (Aug 1995) with ChatGPT's launch (Nov 2022), today lands on **Aug 1999**, seven months before the Nasdaq top. In that time the S&P rose **+85%**, against **+135%** back then.\n\nThe"}]],["a",["generation","message","content",0,"thinkingSignature"],""],["a",["generation","message","content",1,"text"]," full report is in [`docs/research/dotcom-analog.md`](https://github.com/cv/pinance/blob/main/docs/research/dotcom-analog.md), with five charts and the monthly data as a CSV. It's committed and pushed to `main`.\n\n### 1. The overlay\n\n```mermaid\n%%{init: {\"themeVariables\": {\"xyChart\": {\"plotColorPalette\": \"#3b82f6, #ef4444, #22c55e, #f97316\"}}}}%%\nxychart-beta\n    title \"Rebased to 100: Netscape IPO (Aug 1995) vs ChatGPT launch (Nov 2022)\"\n    x-axis [\"M0\", \"​​\", \"​​​\", \"​​​​\", \"M4\", \"​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​\", \"M8\", \"​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"M12\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"M16\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"M20\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"M24\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"M28\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"M32\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​"]]}}]}